{"audit_run_id":"audit:6059446a561e42b58a3589dd1180983e","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":34,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"**File:** `green_roof_survey.csv`"},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"**What one row represents:** one surveyed green roof. Each of the 44 extensive green"},{"end_column":85,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"roofs in the city survey appears exactly once, visited once in late summer, with all"},{"end_column":85,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"five declared outcome variables measured on that visit. There are no repeated visits"},{"end_column":84,"end_line":8,"start_column":1,"start_line":8,"text":"and no missing values, so the table is 44 rows by 7 columns with every cell filled."},{"end_column":39,"end_line":12,"start_column":1,"start_line":12,"text":"| Column | Type | Unit | Description |"},{"end_column":26,"end_line":13,"start_column":1,"start_line":13,"text":"| --- | --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":130,"end_line":14,"start_column":1,"start_line":14,"text":"| `roof_id` | text | none | Short identifier for the roof, `GR01` through `GR44`, following survey visit order. Unique per row. |"},{"end_column":192,"end_line":15,"start_column":1,"start_line":15,"text":"| `substrate_depth` | text | none | Substrate depth class the roof was built to. Exactly two values: `shallow` (growing substrate about 60 mm, 22 roofs) and `deep` (about 120 mm, 22 roofs). |"},{"end_column":146,"end_line":16,"start_column":1,"start_line":16,"text":"| `plant_richness_count` | integer | count of species | Vascular plant species richness: number of vascular plant species recorded on the roof. |"},{"end_column":92,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"| `veg_cover_pct` | number | percent | Vegetation cover as a percentage of the roof area. |"},{"end_column":121,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"| `substrate_moisture_pct` | number | percent | Substrate volumetric moisture during the survey week, as a percentage. |"},{"end_column":194,"end_line":19,"start_column":1,"start_line":19,"text":"| `temp_reduction_c` | number | degrees Celsius | Midday surface temperature reduction measured against the adjacent bare roof membrane. Positive values mean the vegetated surface was cooler. |"},{"end_column":139,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"| `invert_abundance_count` | integer | count of individuals | Flying invertebrate abundance from a standard 30 minute sticky-trap catch. |"},{"end_column":82,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"The five outcome columns appear in the order the survey declared them in advance:"},{"end_column":84,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"species richness, vegetation cover, substrate moisture, temperature reduction, then"},{"end_column":24,"end_line":24,"start_column":1,"start_line":24,"text":"invertebrate abundance."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":28,"start_column":1,"start_line":28,"text":"- `substrate_depth` is the grouping variable, and the two depth classes are balanced"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":29,"start_column":3,"start_line":29,"text":"at 22 roofs each."},{"end_column":86,"end_line":30,"start_column":1,"start_line":30,"text":"- Roof identifiers are not sorted by depth class, because they follow the order roofs"},{"end_column":48,"end_line":31,"start_column":3,"start_line":31,"text":"were visited rather than how they were built."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":32,"start_column":1,"start_line":32,"text":"- All measurements are per roof and cross-sectional. Nothing in the table is paired,"},{"end_column":40,"end_line":33,"start_column":3,"start_line":33,"text":"repeated, or aggregated across roofs."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:361790a7741fd70f6cbb","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:f30070d2aa64ab3b181e07d70484d317bcca515f45d4ca6b1fa31ff1c02b180a","end_line":33,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-33","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:6059446a561e42b58a3589dd1180983e","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":104,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"This study compares the two groups recorded in the `substrate_depth` column of `green_roof_survey.csv`."},{"end_column":161,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"The pre-declared outcome family, in this fixed order, is: plant_richness_count, veg_cover_pct, substrate_moisture_pct, temp_reduction_c, invert_abundance_count."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Each outcome is compared between the two groups. The named outcomes form one outcome"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"family; per-outcome comparisons over this family require complete-family control of the"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"family-wise error from multiple comparisons."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:0f7e0a9fbc3d679bdaef","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:c59d6fdd7ccd7d1db9c724426298c1debaa79c78ee27b6a06b61e0b77c68f834","end_line":7,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-7","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
